psis Medical Technologies Inc. (\u201cwe,\u201d \u201cus,\u201d or \u201cour\u201d) is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website www.synapsismedtech.com, use our services, or interact with us. By using our website and services, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy."}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle1,children:"Information We Collect"}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle2,children:"Personal Data"}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle,children:"While using our website or services, we may ask you to provide us with certain personally identifiable information, including but not limited to:\n- Name\n- Email address\n- Phone number\n- Address\n- Date of birth\n- Payment information (if applicable)"}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle2,children:"Usage Data"}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle,children:"We may collect information on how the service is accessed and used, including but not limited to:\n- Internet Protocol (IP) address\n- Browser type\n- Browser version\n- Pages of our website that you visit\n- Time and date of your visit\n- Time spent on those pages\n- Unique device identifiers\n- Other diagnostic data"}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle2,children:"Tracking Technologies and Cookies"}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle,children:"We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to track the activity on our website and store certain information. Tracking technologies used are beacons, tags, and scripts to collect and track information and to improve and analyze our website. You can instruct your browser to refuse all cookies or to indicate when a cookie is being sent. However, if you do not accept cookies, you may not be able to use some portions of our website."}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle2,children:"Types of Cookies We Use:"}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle,children:"Essential Cookies: These cookies are necessary for the website to function and cannot be switched off in our systems.\nPerformance and Analytics Cookies: These cookies allow us to count visits and traffic sources so we can measure and improve the performance of our website.\nFunctionality Cookies: These cookies enable the website to provide enhanced functionality and personalization.\nAdvertising and Targeting Cookies: These cookies may be set through our website by our advertising partners to build a profile of your interests and show you relevant ads on other sites."}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle2,children:"How We Use Your Data"}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle,children:"We use the information we collect in a variety of ways to provide and improve our services to you. These include:"}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle2,children:"To Provide and Maintain Our Services"}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle,children:"Account Management: To create and manage your account, including processing your registration.\nService Delivery: To deliver the products and services you request, including processing transactions and sending related information such as confirmations and invoices.\nCustomer Support: To provide customer support and respond to your inquiries, including investigating and addressing your concerns and monitoring and improving our responses."}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle2,children:"To Improve Our Services"}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle,children:"Enhancement: To understand and analyze how you use our services so we can develop new products, services, features, and functionality.\nPersonalization: To personalize your experience and deliver content and product offerings relevant to your interests, including targeted offers and ads through our website and third-party sites.\nPerformance Monitoring: To monitor and analyze usage and activity trends to improve the functionality of our website and services."}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle2,children:"To Communicate with You"}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle,children:"Updates and Notifications: To send you technical notices, updates, security alerts, and support and administrative messages.\nMarketing and Promotional Activities: To communicate with you about products, services, offers, promotions, and events we think may interest you. You can opt-out of receiving these communications at any time."}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle2,children:"To Ensure Compliance and Security"}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle,children:"Legal Obligations: To comply with applicable laws, regulations, and legal processes.\nSecurity: To protect, investigate, and deter against fraudulent, unauthorized, or illegal activity, and to ensure the security of our website and services.\nEnforcement: To enforce our terms, conditions, and policies, and to respond to legal requests and prevent harm."}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle2,children:"To Aggregate and Anonymize Data"}),(0,l.jsx)(s.View,{style:{height:20}}),(0,l.jsx)(s.Text,{style:f.textstyle,children:"Research and Analysis: To produce aggregated insights that do not identify you, for research and analysis purposes to understand trends and improve our services.\nProduct Development: To develop ne